<section id="A5" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix E </span>Model parameters</h2>

<section id="A5.SS0.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">BabyLM corpus</h4>

<div id="A5.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The composition of the BabyLM corpus is listed in <a href="#A4.T4" title="In Appendix D Evaluation instructions ‣ Once Upon a Time:Interactive Learning for Storytelling with Small Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Table</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a>. It comprises 100 M words, of which we use 90% for pretraining and tokenization.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A5.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">E.1 </span>Pretraining</h3>

<section id="A5.SS1.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Model and training</h4>

<div id="A5.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The model parameters are listed in <a href="#A5.T5" title="In Model and training ‣ E.1 Pretraining ‣ Appendix E Model parameters ‣ Once Upon a Time:Interactive Learning for Storytelling with Small Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Table</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>. The vocab size of the tokenizer is 16,000 to match the baseline <span id="A5.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_typewriter">1000M-pre</span> and the interaction baseline <span id="A5.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">SimPO</span>, which have vocab size 16,384. We use different values for seed, batch size, gradient accumulation, and learning rate compared with the baselines.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A5.T5" class="ltx_table">
<table id="A5.T5.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
